From e9f4ba4fd49508f806e9843864c3064bca9b66a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:11:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/45] Send the match summary in the Specula feed

Kind 25 carries GuiInterface.GetSpeculaSummaries: the replay metadata
once with every player and once per seat, filtered to Gaia, the seat
and the mutual allies it shares LOS with.
---
 .../simulation/components/GuiInterface.js     | 32 ++++++++
 source/network/SpeculaFeed.cpp                | 76 +++++++++++++++++++
 source/network/SpeculaFeed.h                  | 15 ++++
 3 files changed, 123 insertions(+)

diff --git a/binaries/data/mods/public/simulation/components/GuiInterface.js b/binaries/data/mods/public/simulation/components/GuiInterface.js
